# Legal Notices & Licenses

The "Luckfox Lyra Hardened SDK" project aggregates open-source software components governed by various open-source licenses, alongside defensive hardening contributions and robustness patches.

---

## 1. Linux Kernel (Linux Kernel 6.1 LTS)
* **License:** GNU General Public License version 2 (GPL-2.0)
* **Original Authors:** Linus Torvalds and the Linux kernel contributors (see `COPYING` and individual file headers).
* **Rockchip Adaptations:** Rockchip Electronics Co., Ltd.
* **Hardening and Fixes:** Project maintenance team (robustness fixes, MTD/Vendor Storage boundary validation, RPMSG channel sanitization).
* A complete copy of the GPL-2.0 license is available in the `kernel-6.1/COPYING` directory.

---

## 2. AIC8800 Wi-Fi / Bluetooth Driver (`external/rkwifibt/drivers/aic8800`)
* **License:** GNU General Public License version 2 (GPL-2.0)
* **Original Authors:** AICSemi (AICSemi Inc.) & Rockchip Electronics Co., Ltd.
* **Sanitization and Robustness:**
  - Strict validation of incoming/outgoing USB packet lengths (`aicwf_usb.c`).
  - Boundary checking on network buffers and frame limits (`rwnx_rx.c`, `aicwf_txrxif.c`).
  - Protection against integer overflows and boundary violations in vendor private ioctl commands (`aic_priv_cmd.c`).
  - Hardened Bluetooth firmware loading routine (`aicbluetooth.c`).

---

